Staff Report
November 24, 2014
Page 3

DESCRIPTION OF SITE AND SURROUNDINGS:
The subject property is contiguous to City of Cheyenne jurisdictional boundaries on the south and west
sides of the parcel and is within the Urban Service Boundary. The property slopes to the south as the
development approaches Council Bluff; vegetation includes native grasses and shrubs. Currently there are
no sewer or water utilities in place to serve the property. The property owner will be required to extend
the sewer and water main utilities to the property upon development.

Annexed area denoted by dashed line.

Facing the subject property looking east.
